---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="项目 · rain" description="rain 的公开项目、课程实践与持续迭代记录。" active="projects" bodyClass="interior-v2 projects-v2">
  <main class="interior-main">
    <header class="interior-hero">
      <div class="interior-copy v2-reveal">
        <p class="v2-kicker">PROJECTS / BUILD LOG</p>
        <h1>项目<br /><em>不是摆设。</em></h1>
        <p>这里集中展示正在维护和已经完成的公开仓库。首页只保留最近动态，完整项目统一从这一页进入。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interior-poster project-poster v2-reveal" data-art-stage aria-hidden="true">
        <span>BUILD / 001</span>
        <strong>MAKE<br />SHIP</strong>
        <i></i><b>↗</b>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="project-directory">
      <div class="interior-section-head v2-reveal">
        <div><span>01</span><p class="v2-kicker">PUBLIC REPOSITORIES</p><h2>公开仓库</h2></div>
        <span class="repo-live"><i></i>与 GitHub 同步</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-directory-list v2-reveal">
        <div class="github-repo-list" data-github-repos data-repo-limit="9">
          <div class="repo-skeleton"><i></i><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="repo-skeleton"><i></i><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
        <a class="project-all" href="https://github.com/rain-lei?tab=repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在 GitHub 查看全部仓库 <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-method">
      <div class="interior-section-head v2-reveal"><div><span>02</span><p class="v2-kicker">WORKING METHOD</p><h2>项目如何留下来</h2></div></div>
      <div class="method-grid">
        <article class="v2-reveal"><small>01 / CODE</small><h3>代码</h3><p>可运行的实现、清楚的目录，以及能够继续修改的基础。</p></article>
        <article class="v2-reveal"><small>02 / NOTES</small><h3>记录</h3><p>保留问题、取舍和调试过程，不只留下最终截图。</p></article>
        <article class="v2-reveal"><small>03 / RELEASE</small><h3>发布</h3><p>能部署的项目尽量提供在线入口，让结果可以直接验证。</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
